+# =============================================================================
+# ANALYSIS EXTENSIONS  (FFT, Wavelet, Simulated Annealing, Plotting)
+# Les Wright / Extended additions
+# Requires: numpy (already present), scipy, pywt, matplotlib
+#   pip install scipy pywt matplotlib
